5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I think we should look closely at how previous transitions were handled to avoid past mistakes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We need to ensure the new system is compatible with the actual conditions on the depot floor.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I want to see if we've been lazy with our updates or just unlucky.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the human element. We need to know if the staff can actually handle another rollout.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasure to be here. I suspect the ""sticker price"" is a fairy tale, so I'll be hunting for the hidden costs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that's a fair point. I'm personally worried about accountability and how plans drift over time.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll be focusing on the physical infrastructure and the timing of the cutover to avoid operational paralysis.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, you're always so serious! I'm looking for the ""ghosts"" in the machine—the things we forgot to fix.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I want to see who is actually doing the work and how long it takes to replace them.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I shall look into the financial trail to see where the money actually flows after the ink dries.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
