35,2,1,talk,Midori,,I've found some concerning patterns. It seems we struggle with clear ownership and keeping our plans aligned with business changes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"My findings confirm my fears. Our yard hardware is outdated, and our peak season is too volatile for a standard cutover.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh, it's just as I suspected. We have a habit of letting things rot and paying people to break our data.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The situation is precarious. We are losing the people who hold the knowledge, and the crews aren't adopting the training.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,How fascinating. It seems we have a talent for ignoring the slow bleed of operating costs while celebrating the initial purchase.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, if the hardware is the issue, we need a vendor who is flexible with legacy devices.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. If the vendor assumes we have modern tablets in every yard, the project will fail on day one.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"Or we just hire another ""expert"" to fix the mess in two years. No, let's actually pick someone who doesn't just patch things.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,A complex system will only break us further. We need a vendor that prioritizes simplicity and ease of training.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Simplicity is lovely, Misaki, provided it doesn't come with a ""simplicity surcharge"" that doubles every renewal cycle.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that if we don't find a vendor with a strong governance model, we'll just repeat the same cycle.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will prioritize any candidate that provides a phased rollout plan that respects the peak-season blackout.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm looking for a vendor who takes ownership of the long-term health of the system, not just the installation.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If the vendor requires a high level of internal admin expertise, we cannot afford them. We have no one left.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall be voting for the candidate whose pricing model is the most transparent and least prone to ""creative"" inflation.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
